#' @param p_ct Facility City Filter. Enter a single case-insensitive city name to filter results.
#' @param p_dmr_tri_link DMR facility links to TRI ID Flag. Provide a Y or N to restrict results to DMR facilities that do or do not link to TRI ID(s).
#' @param p_end_date Monitoring Period End Date. Provide a date value in MM/YYYY format to specify the last monitoring period to include in results. Parameter p_start_date must also be populated when using this parameter.
#' @param p_esa ESA-listed species flag. Provide Y or N to restrict results to DMR facilities that do or do not discharge to counties w/ ESA-listed species
#' @param p_est Estimation Function Flag. A Y value will estimates loads when monitoring data are not reported for one or more monitoring periods in a reporting year. If not specified, defaults to Y.
#' @param p_exceed Effluent limit exceedance flag. Provide Y or N to restrict results to DMR facilities with or with no effluent limit exceedances
#' @param p_fac_type Facility Type. Provide a coded value to filter on a facility type.
