#' - NON-POTW = Industrial Point Sources (non-POTW)
#' - FEDERAL = Federal facilities
#' - STATE = State facilities
#' @param p_fifra FIFRA Flag. A Y value will limit results to pesticide-producing establishments regulated under FIFRA.
#' @param p_fname Facility Name Filter. Enter a full or partial facility name to restrict results. 
#' @param p_huc 2-, 4-, 6-, or 8-character watershed code. May contain multiple comma-separated values.
#' @param p_huc_region HUC Region. 2-digit Hydrologic Unit Code
