#' @param p_imp_water Discharge to impaired waterbodies flag. Provide Y or N to restrict results to DMR facilities that discharge to impaired waterbodies.
#' @param p_intermittent_disch Intermittent Discharges Flag. A Y value will limit results to facilities with intermittent discharges.
#' @param p_lat Latitude location in decimal degrees.
